\newlabel{fig:cnn_hierarchy}{{8}{9}{Hierarchical feature learning in CNNs. Early layers detect simple patterns (edges), later layers detect complex structures (objects). Receptive field grows with depth; spatial resolution decreases}{figure.8}{}}
